      "text": "Move slots. All 4 Slots show even if Empty. \nShows 4 slots (grey rectangles) with 1 move per slot until bonding\nBonded moves show in same slot with 1 move per Dark Grey Circle in a Slot.\nRun time",
      "fontSize": 10.714285714285714,
      "baseFontSize": 10.714285714285714,
