      "seed": 1981141421,
      "version": 649,
      "versionNonce": 598045515,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794966555772,
      "created": 1794866595488,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same belt set up as the Catch Menu, but sized up.\n\nBuy Buttons: \nAllows purchase of belt. temporary price of 10,000 and\n15,000. use the menu button (same as Team Menu and\nCatch Menu without icons)\nUnfocused: standard #ffffff rim, #181818 flat body,\nWhite text if able to purchase, White@45% if unable to\npurchase\nFocused (only focuses if able to purchase): #38d030\nrim, #181818 body, White text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "otTWCIBDKjMB54L1RxkH7",
      "originalText": "Same belt set up as the Catch Menu, but sized up.\n\nBuy Buttons: \nAllows purchase of belt. temporary price of 10,000 and 15,000. use the menu button (same as Team Menu and Catch Menu without icons)\nUnfocused: standard #ffffff rim, #181818 flat body, White text if able to purchase, White@45% if unable to purchase\nFocused (only focuses if able to purchase): #38d030 rim, #181818 body, White text",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "_Bj4gX2O2Wk4kEsUiN55F",
