      "updated": 1794966555772,
      "created": 1794874673522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Container holding 3 columns of TR cards. Scroll bar.\n\nSearch bar by name, filter dropdown by type, toggle button labeled \"Able to \\n Learn\" in White@60% small right of button.\n\nTR Card: \n#29ceff thin rim, #303030 panel body\nImage from `assets\\items\\pokesprite-inventory.png`. specific pokesprite.tr.* used matches the move type.\nDivider line #495151 between image and panel text, does not reach rim.\nPanel Text: Name #8cfff7 on its own line. Smaller text is short description of move in #white.\nBuy Button  \nAllows purchase of a TR. Temporary prices. uses the menu button (same as Team Menu and Catch Menu without icons). Text \"Buy\n$N\". Shift-Click skips Confirmation Popup.\nUnfocused: standard #ffffff rim, #181818 flat body, White text if able to afford, White@45% if unable to afford\nFocused (only focuses if able to afford): #38d030 rim, #181818 body, White text",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "K4O2FqayUNXUwDjfT9mUj",
      "originalText": "Container holding 3 columns of TR cards. Scroll bar.\n\nSearch bar by name, filter dropdown by type, toggle button labeled \"Able to \\n Learn\" in White@60% small right of button.\n\nTR Card: \n#29ceff thin rim, #303030 panel body\nImage from `assets\\items\\pokesprite-inventory.png`. specific pokesprite.tr.* used matches the move type.\nDivider line #495151 between image and panel text, does not reach rim.\nPanel Text: Name #8cfff7 on its own line. Smaller text is short description of move in #white.\nBuy Button  \nAllows purchase of a TR. Temporary prices. uses the menu button (same as Team Menu and Catch Menu without icons). Text \"Buy $N\". Shift-Click skips Confirmation Popup.\nUnfocused: standard #ffffff rim, #181818 flat body, White text if able to afford, White@45% if unable to afford\nFocused (only focuses if able to afford): #38d030 rim, #181818 body, White text",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
