      "text": "Tabs\n\nThese are selected via icons at `assets\\ui\\shop_icons\\*`\nThe black base colored outline is the unselected tab. The inverted white\nbase is the selected tab.\nTop to bottom is pokeball, character-upgrade, team-item, tm-purchase. ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sqw_BugMNtAFnlajdRoR2",
      "originalText": "Tabs\n\nThese are selected via icons at `assets\\ui\\shop_icons\\*`\nThe black base colored outline is the unselected tab. The inverted white base is the selected tab.\nTop to bottom is pokeball, character-upgrade, team-item, tm-purchase. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
